      "key": [
        "Tupac last stand",
        "Tupac Sacred Flame",
        "Tupac carried Mavuika"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Tupac: Final Battle and the Sacred Flame",
      "content": "In the \"Sunset\" short, Tupac drinks with Wanjiru, Menilek and Sundjatta the night before the last battle and jokes about it. In the fight, Menilek dies with a monster in a headlock, Sundjatta falls to a blow meant for Wanjiru, and Tupac, gravely wounded, carries the unconscious Mavuika up to the Sacred Flame. He tells her she is their flame and must burn on and never go out. By the time she wakes he is standing motionless and dead. She then places her life in the flame.",
