        "Ash-Graven Drinking Horn",
        "Tupac's drinking horn"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Tupac: Ash-Graven Drinking Horn",
      "content": "A ritual vessel passed down among the Meztli (People of the Springs). The weapon text, a storyteller's song, has the young Tenoch demand it from Tupac and Tupac answer that he must wrestle him first. The horn was a treasure much valued and never used in battle. In the song, Tupac later offers the horn before the Pyro Archon, a gesture of his last hope.",
