      "key": [
        "Umoja",
        "Mualani and Tupac"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Tupac: Umoja and Mualani",
      "content": "Mavuika's plan: each tribe's Wayob would acknowledge one hero who inherits an original hero's Ancient Name. After Mualani helped Kachina in the Night Kingdom, Tupac appeared to her, told her that her Name would let her unite the tribes, touched fists with her and vanished, transferring his memories to her. Mavuika later confirmed that Umoja means \"unity\" and is the Name once held by the hero of Mualani's tribe.",
